{
  "about": [
    "Which e2e specs a pull request runs (e2e/ci-select.mjs; docs/areas/ops.md, 'CI e2e'). Paths are globs from the repo's root: * within a folder, ** across folders.",
    "Each changed path, in this order: a 'full' path runs the whole suite; otherwise every area whose paths match adds its specs; otherwise a 'none' path adds nothing; any other path runs the whole suite (fail-safe).",
    "A changed spec always runs itself. The 'smoke' specs run on every pull request. 'leftOut' specs never run on a pull request (the @perf specs). A push to main always runs everything.",
    "A new file outside every area runs the whole suite until it's added here: add it to its area (or a new one) when that's clear; leave shared code out, so it keeps running everything."
  ],
  "smoke": [
    "e2e/boss-smoke.spec.ts",
    "e2e/front-door.spec.ts",
    "e2e/boss-character.spec.ts",
    "e2e/lobby-chat.spec.ts"
  ],
  "leftOut": ["e2e/perf.spec.ts"],
